{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "65b86a5f173f975878b3a011d0797615c7817af135db4f6a01420406afca8d7f", "ja": "（今日のオーディションは、次の子で終わりか。\n最後は……あの大人しそうな子だな）", "zh": "（今天的甄选只剩下一位了。\n最后是……那个看起来很沉稳的孩子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "222a1ba02aa176c2a7a9dee7bf0448325ee0f3dff47bdd3923812d1048b77d1c", "ja": "高山紗代子です。本日はオーディションに\n参加させていただき、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "我是高山纱代子。\n非常感谢今天有这个荣幸参加甄选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "7e385cba33403ae70f1e8ed8c83d47340bfdfc028126876dafb87087fe5cab70", "ja": "合格できるよう精一杯頑張りますので、\nどうかよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我会尽全力加油，希望能顺利录取，\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "db62e5e6e41d42a11a422e8ed74727aa60d1bac98cd6c63026f9f7e9c98f685e", "ja": "うん、そんなに堅くならなくていいよ。\nまずは肩の力を抜こうか。", "zh": "嗯，你不用那么拘谨啦。\n先放轻松吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "4012a5b3838e5efae0f8b528a6cc52b695131b12080a95f7a708af14f40ace25", "ja": "そ、そうですか？\nすみません、失礼しましたっ！", "zh": "是、是吗？\n不好意思，失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "676fd1fc0538725a94c7bd6641eb889f54c1f3238a0e34c97e6f6cfbfddce003", "ja": "（やっぱり見た目通り、真面目そうな子だな。\nアイドルに興味があるタイプには見えないけど……）", "zh": "（果然跟外表一样，是个老实的孩子呢。\n但看起来不像是会对偶像有兴趣的类型……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ebd91bb5008ee46202abdbaf04fa97c1d33bf0c67232590e14d269e5c3263f07", "ja": "それじゃあ質問を始めます。\nどうしてアイドルになろうと思ったのかな？", "zh": "那我要来问你几个问题。\n你为什么会想当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "2b87441671863b8b7c70a9721fd884572ac3ec6c505fd096d530880558219fc4", "ja": "えっ……そ、それは、その……。", "zh": "咦……这、这是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d53172910a29bb8746e9e4c2f9daaad0749fcafd2ea04c460d5ff31ebdc9a307", "ja": "恥ずかしがらなくていいから、\n正直な気持ちを聞かせてほしいな。", "zh": "不用害羞，\n把真正的想法告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "bba996b6f66b955124da0e0512586f597efea8d9df51bd4c22d7305593b9779f", "ja": "……アイドルになることが、私の夢だからです。\nアイドルになれるなら、なんだってできます！", "zh": "……因为当偶像是我的梦想。\n如果能当上偶像，我什么都愿意做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "01203d30be8052d5b8d52d2f9713bb737fe239ebf44cd0d7a17ed8f6e253c47b", "ja": "（すごい気合いと覚悟だな……何か事情があるのか？\nそれを知りたいところだけど……）", "zh": "（好惊人的气势和觉悟……是有什么缘由吗？\n好想知道原因……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "46f3ae7414d4b690d78f2f5d89d0e9f6e28be23fec34ad10f1735a42b13f327f", "ja": "それだけ強い気持ちがあるっていうことは、\n今まで、他のオーディションも受けたりした？", "zh": "既然你意志这么坚决，\n那你从前也参加过其他甄选啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "2c6bddebfb4ca37746da705cfbfa9c6f5b843f34657aba6ca725e0b8c9bcc183", "ja": "はい。自分で調べて、\nいくつものオーディションを受けました。", "zh": "是的。我自己去查资料，\n参加过几场甄选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "dc05c785f7ad060eacd31da6795ce6a074752faeb0cfeae302671544d5c5b6a2", "ja": "でも、連戦連敗中で……もう後がないんです。\nこれが私にとって、最後のチャンスなんです！", "zh": "可是每次都失败……我已经没有退路了。\n这次对我来说是最后的机会了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d2f7339807394dc677b4ed572965dc7059a1ad071145df59f5e06162af4269e0", "ja": "そう……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "cd89ced8dc973b29d5e3f321a1e33846875f0f486f5e2b1fe43eed516dc31ac2", "ja": "あっ！　でも39プロジェクトのオーディションを\n選んだ理由は、それだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊！不过我会选择参加39PROJECT的甄选，\n不只是因为这点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "429b8d85bf8ecd70f997fe9f29b6058d2810e221d50e9ccd8ea42a133a9081af", "ja": "魅力的な部分がたくさんあったので、\n選びました！", "zh": "而是因为这个企划充满了魅力，\n所以我才会选的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7bf3b25b70bf263e0f0b7958cf3cf998a70c5caea2fb8e245f0741bf6bb3a715", "ja": "はは、そんなに気を遣わなくてもいいよ。\nとにかく、アイドルになる。それが重要なんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，用不着那么小心啦。\n总之，你的重点就是要当偶像对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "89184219bed4827c72f3c211fe4e3cc49f49a5f839b3eec6e16a5905e27b699b", "ja": "そうです。\n私は、どうしてもアイドルになりたい……。", "zh": "没错。\n我无论如何都想当偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "f52c5b0b271ea1de450e4a2c9eb54d0b0f5ce5655ba453c6b68040835edb2c9c", "ja": "たとえ、何度オーディションに落ちても……\nアイドルになれるまで、絶対に諦めません！", "zh": "不管在甄选中落选多少次……\n在当上偶像之前，我是绝对不会放弃的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "181b9abd88e8a6c4daaf35d779d05be1c7272fed72a1c713791136963f672ee2", "ja": "（真剣な表情だな。この目が、\nウソを吐いているようには思えない……）", "zh": "（这表情很认真呢。\n看她这双眼睛，不像在说谎……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "5ad5036040c97bd7379c014e417b1181c357751cc7a6e2405117b500e5ffbe08", "ja": "まだまだ未熟者ですが、私をアイドルにしてください！\nどうか、お願いします！", "zh": "虽然我还不够成熟，但请让我当上偶像吧！\n拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bfce77d95563376d2deb0cb21819e3d7a04df2fa18b9cad5e1ba530a9aaaf0aa", "ja": "（……この熱意は本物だ。もしかしたら、\nすごいアイドルになる可能性があるかもしれない！）", "zh": "（……这份热情是货真价实的。\n说不定她有机会成为很棒的偶像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_1023", "source_sha256": "82ba7c0d8c36a1f2eea44a72c4f98c86ac32928739faf770b0e6dad375a952d7", "ja": "合格だ！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "545f738f6c294603bb751bc3ca1965f1ab7b05d0f7f3dd5f48b0bcacb8665fa9", "ja": "よし、合格だ！\n一緒に頑張っていこう。", "zh": "很好，你被录取了！\n今后我们一起加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_2001_027say", "source_sha256": "eeaa2d4658b741dd42777dea37987ab887383acdc30496b50d41eeaee68956ed", "ja": "えっ！？\n……い、いいんですか！？", "zh": "咦！？\n……真、真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "13eadf58ada90c49fe0a41357fdc1f6ab279f92d8d912adb03ba972a3fb5a3be", "ja": "アイドルになりたいって言ったじゃないか。\nそれだけの熱意と覚悟があれば、十分だよ。", "zh": "你不是说想当偶像吗？\n既然你这么有热情与觉悟，那就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_2003_027say", "source_sha256": "02d1d5af903b3e80f8beeb21309b03fb056faf34b512371d7ddb05886d74afae", "ja": "あ……、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "非……非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_2004_027say", "source_sha256": "2f9b2c25128038c622c2a86822ceb3ee8f6fa8fcdd3200c0a8c86aaa1dc2bd0f", "ja": "私、全身全霊で頑張ります！\nどうか、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我会全神贯注、好好努力的！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_027say_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_027say_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "e2021ad2fc04f2bf6534727f85b2ae0acac07a0bd18686025d41e4a945735e1a", "ja": "（この子ほどの熱意があれば、きっと\nトップアイドルを目指せるはずだ……！）", "zh": "（这孩子这么有热情，\n一定能以顶尖偶像为目标……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
